# Semantic replay: recordings are local by default (replay/cache.jsonl and any
# other *.jsonl). Only replay/demo.jsonl, a reviewed copy of real LIVE answers
# to the scenario inputs, may be committed. See replay/README.md.
replay/*.jsonl
!replay/demo.jsonl
